  "description": "The item **Aegis of Dawn** is an ornate shield emblem that grants a subtle glow to the wearer, symbolizing resilience. Classified under the **Emblems** category (internal name \u201cemblems\u201d) and the **Shield Emblems** subcategory (internal name \u201cshield_emblems\u201d, order\u202f3), it is a wearable cosmetic piece. Its rarity type is **Epic**, with a gold rarity rating, and it is not a mythic item nor a certification item; it is always visible even to players who have not yet acquired it. The emblem is usable in the game modes **Capture the Flag** and **Team Deathmatch**.\n\nFor reference, the large image for the Aegis of Dawn can be found at the URL\u202fhttpshttps://example.com/assets/images/aegis_of_dawn.png. The item costs **1,500** credits, requires a player level of **20**, and carries the internal identifiers **item-987654** (item ID) and **content-abc123** (content ID). No certification requisition ID is associated with this emblem."
